  ('Rice Vinegar', 'This vinegar provides a stimulating contrast of flavour that brings almost any food to life. Besides being a mainstay in salad dressings, pickling mixtures and marinades, it also perks up vegetable dishes, sauces, dips and spreads.', 3.75, '250ml', 'Pantry', 'International', 35.0, 138.0, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'organic', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
  ('Smoky Chilli Oil', 'For those of you that know White Mausu sauces. This one''s a little different. It''s got a lot less bits but no less flavour. The oil has been deeply infused in a two part process and they''ve used a type of Chipotle called Morita Chilli to bring that fruity smoky funk. It''s a chilli oil and its applications are endless — all the usuals, bowls of rice', 6.99, 'each', 'Preserves & Condiments', 'International', 53.34, -6.26, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
