  ('100% Extra Virgin Olive Oil Crisps', 'One of the classics and a favourite of many. The golden elixir with a fruity flavour that balances richness and elegance, from a family mill in Andalusia.', 4.8, 'each', 'Pantry', 'International', 41.59, 1.4, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
  ('Avocado Oil & Sea Salt Crisps', 'A silky and sublime experience, with an ethereal texture and an irresistible golden color, nuanced with a pinch of sea salt that enhances its most genuine flavors.', 4.8, 'each', 'Pantry', 'International', 41.59, 1.4, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
  ('Buckwheat Grain', 'An award-winning, organic, and nutritious buckwheat. Grechka parboiled buckwheat retains its nutritional value and great taste, unlike roasted varieties. Packed with over 50 vitamins and minerals such as iron, potassium, phosphorus, and magnesium, it supports hemoglobin, blood vessels, bones, and the endocrine and vascular systems. Antioxidants reg', 5.5, '400g', 'Pantry', 'International', 50.45, 30.52, false, ARRAY['gluten'], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'organic', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
  ('Scotch Bonnet Hot Honey', 'Wilderbee hot honey is the perfect blend of sweet and spicy. You can drizzle it or pair it with pizza, as they do in Brooklyn. The sweet honey cuts through the richness. The honey is infused with sustainably grown Scotch bonnet chillies. Their fruity, fiery flavour is a great match for honey''s mellow sweetness. Once you try it, you''ll be hooked. In', 8.5, 'each', 'Preserves & Condiments', 'UK', 51.5, -0.13, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['gluten-free', 'organic']),
