  ('Still Water', 'Tŷ Nant still is light and very low in minerals. Tŷ Nant is bottled at source in the Welsh Cambrian Mountains, an area of mudstone, siltstone and sandstone that is protected and organically managed.', 3.0, '750ml', 'Drinks', 'UK', 52.05, -3.85, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'organic', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
  ('Sparkling Water', 'Tau is bottled at source in the Welsh Cambrian Mountains, an area of mudstone, siltstone and sandstone that is protected and organically managed. Tau sparkling has very loud bubbles and should be paired with a food with a substantial mouthfeel. Chic and minimalist, the bottle is inspired by the Welsh verb Tau which means to be silent.', 1.5, '330ml', 'Drinks', 'UK', 52.05, -3.85, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'organic', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
  ('Still Water', 'Tau is bottled at source in the Welsh Cambrian Mountains, an area of mudstone, siltstone and sandstone that is protected and organically managed. Tau still is light and very low in minerals. Chic and minimalist, the bottle is inspired by the Welsh verb Tau which means to be silent.', 1.5, '330ml', 'Drinks', 'UK', 52.05, -3.85, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'organic', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
  ('Preserved Lemon & Dill Nut Ferment', 'This preserved lemon and fermented cashew dip uses whole preserved Sicilian green lemons and cold-pressed extra virgin olive oil. It''s zesty and bright; balanced beautifully with aromatic dill and black peppercorns. Stir through pasta, pair with fish, spread onto bagels, or dress salads.', 8.5, 'each', 'Cheese', 'UK', 51.5, -0.13, false, ARRAY['fish', 'nuts'], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'organic', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
  ('Mushroom Truffle Pâté', 'A completely zero-waste product, taking the excess liquid from Symplicity''s mushroom and vegetable ferments, then combining it with a fermented cashew base, white truffle oil, fresh lemon juice and a dash of maple syrup. The result is a creamy, intensely umami, savoury pâté-style dip.', 10.5, 'each', 'Pantry', 'UK', 51.5, -0.13, false, ARRAY['nuts'], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
