  ('Fruit & Nut 38% Milk Chocolate', 'A classic combination reimagined. Plump raisins and crunchy almonds are set into silky Valrhona 38% milk chocolate, forming a bar full of texture, warmth, and nostalgia.', 6.95, '90g', 'Pantry', 'UK', 50.823, -0.137, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['gluten-free']),
