  ('Tunisian Shakhouka', 'The Worlds Finest Tunisian Harissa in a Shakshouka, made with only the best ingredients. A family run and produced product with its roots in the heart of Tunis. The recipe has been passed down through generations of Lamiris, imported directly from La Marsa, Tunisia to bring you the best sauce, straight from the source. With endless versatility; add', 4.75, 'each', 'Preserves & Condiments', 'International', 36.81, 10.18, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
  ('Matcha Crunch 70% Dark Chocolate', 'A mindful infusion of Virunga 70% dark chocolate with organic Matcha Iri Genmaicha, the revered Japanese tea blend of sencha, matcha and roasted brown rice grains. The fresh, sweet, buttery notes of Matcha Iri Genmaicha are enhanced by subtle umami depth, pairing perfectly with the earthy, fruity, black tea flavours of Virunga chocolate. Ethically', 6.5, 'each', 'Pantry', 'UK', 55.95, -3.19, false, ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['dairy-free', 'gluten-free', 'organic', 'vegan', 'vegetarian']),
